  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62340,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 92,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> two or more malignant germ cell components.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:53:30"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62341,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 92,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "<p>This entity is staged according to the Union for International Cancer Control (UICC) TNM classification (see <em>TNM staging of ovarian, fallopian tube, and primary peritoneal carcinoma</em>&nbsp;[[Brierley JD, Gospodarowicz MK, Wittekind C, editors. TNM classification of malignant tumours. 8th ed. Oxford (UK): Wiley-Blackwell; 2017.]]) and the FIGO staging system.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-15T11:39:58"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62342,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 92,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The most important prognostic factor is stage. With current chemotherapy, the components that are present have less impact on the prognosis than in the past, but because the chemosensitivity of the various components differs {28372870}, the percentage of each component in the overall tumour should be reported.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:53:30"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]